  "body": "BitNet.cpp Demo on Google Colab: CPU-based Testing\r\n\r\nThis PR introduces a demo for BitNet.cpp running on Google Colab's CPU environment. Key features:\r\n\r\n1. Demonstrates BitNet.cpp capabilities on standard CPUs\r\n2. Fully automated setup process\r\n3. Designed for quick and easy testing\r\n\r\nThe demo showcases how BitNet.cpp can perform AI model inference on CPUs, making it accessible for devices without high-end GPUs.\r\n\r\nTesting instructions and expected outputs are included in the demo notebook.",
